c(118,93,'Changing the coefficient field to a ring preserves the finite-length endomorphism category and its simple classification unchanged.','false as stated','B','The correct general-ring exact category uses finite projective modules. WeibelII7.4.3 states Almkvist’s rational-Witt theorem in that setting; finite length is a different condition.',['Weibel2013','Almkvist1974'],'ENDO','Z andZ/p counterexamples in root_checks.md §6; refined SA05-C159.',refined='SA05-C159')
